      "sourceEntry": 1097,
      "speaker": "RODNEY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "I’m sorry I haven’t fulfilled your expectations on this holiday. You must appreciate it’s been very difficult in this confined space. And. Of course the rain…",
